    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"repeat\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f501\" role=\"img\" title=\"repeat\">:repeat:</span> theotherjimmy submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14475#pullrequestreview-5444955150\">PR review</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Minor nits. Aside from some unused labels, this looks good.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 629903077,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791390141
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> theotherjimmy created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14475#discussion_r4209093577\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Unless I'm mistaken, this should work too: </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">cmp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x27</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x26</span>\n<span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ne</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">swap</span>\n<span class=\"n\">cmp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x21</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x23</span>\n<span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ne</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">swap</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>With the bonus that it's shorter.</p>\n<p>This is also the only place I saw cinc and csinc used, so that could be moved out of this PR too.</p>\n<p>Note: this is not required, only nice to have.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 629903079,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791390141
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> theotherjimmy created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14475#discussion_r4209213295\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Out label appears to be unused. Can this be removed?</p>\n</blockquote>",
