    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"memo\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4dd\" role=\"img\" title=\"memo\">:memo:</span> Gelbpunkt submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14475#pullrequestreview-5446059141\">PR review</a>.</p>",
        "id": 629922180,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791394722
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> Gelbpunkt created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14475#discussion_r4210029466\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Indeed, that should also work, but would deviate from LLVM. I presume LLVM tries to avoid branches as much as possible, but I'll use your suggestion and remove cinc/csinc, I think I prefer a smaller diff here</p>\n</blockquote>",
