    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> Gelbpunkt created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14475#discussion_r4210327297\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>(Since we don't want to swap when they're not equal, we branch to the keep case and therefore I switched the swap and keep cases around, but it works as intended now without cinc/csinc)</p>\n</blockquote>",
